OL,3,GNEWSAPrince Harry honours girl who
OL,4,Adefied all the odds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seven-year-old girl whose mother says
OL,7,Fshe has "defied the odds to walk and
OL,8,Ftalk and even survive" has collected an
OL,9,FInspirational Child award from the Duke
OL,10,Fof Sussex.
OL,12,FMargot Jones-Billington, from
OL,13,FNorthampton, was one of the winners in
OL,14,Fthe 4-6 age category of the 2026
OL,15,FWellChild Awards, which Prince Harry is
OL,16,Fa patron of.
OL,18,FShe was nominated by her mother, Laura
OL,19,FJones-Billington, and chosen due to her
OL,20,Fcourage, determination and positivity
OL,21,Fwhile living with a serious illness.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
