OL,3,GNEWSAPrince Harry honours girl who
OL,4,Adefied all the odds
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura said when Margot was 20 months
OL,7,Fold, she went to bed and the next day
OL,8,Fthey discovered she had a ruptured
OL,9,Farteriovenous malformation (AVM) which
OL,10,Fcaused a catastrophic bleed on the
OL,11,Fbrain.
